@startuml

autonumber
hide footbox

title SSD: US017 - Create a private Publication List

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User

User -> System : I want to create a new private list
activate System

System --> User : Please provide the list name and genre

User -> System : Name and genre provided

System --> User : The private list was created successfully

deactivate System
deactivate User

@enduml
